  "headline_finding": "Both runs completed_valid: Stage 0 fixture identities held; Stage 1's mandatory independence-verification found ZERO (p,B,t_used) collisions across matched curve_ordinals in either run, confirming the two curve families are genuinely independently constructed this time (fixing EXP-MONO-670aa6's total collision); Stage 2's dual-test (Holm AND Fisher-combined) null-object gate passed cleanly in both tests, both families, both seeds, with all statistics far from significance (min Fisher-combined p=0.43 across both runs); Stage 3's real-arm P1-P6 show no significant result in either family, either test, either run; Stage 4's extended, persisted dual-path residual check found no threshold breach. This is the first of the lane's three K3/K4 attempts whose declared instrument was verified, both at design time and by independent execution, to have genuine statistical power. Disclosed: a thirteenth out-of-band commit (CORR-20260831-d663e0) correctly identified an alpha-inflation issue in the Stage-2 gate's own composite definition, independently verified empirically inconsequential to these specific runs.",
